WEBVTT

00:02:59.458 --> 00:03:02.168
That's most of us here.

00:03:02.168 --> 00:03:07.098
Okay, now do the same for your driving ability.

00:03:07.098 --> 00:03:09.681
How interesting are you?

00:03:09.681 --> 00:03:12.525
How attractive are you?

00:03:12.525 --> 00:03:15.479
How honest are you?

00:03:15.479 --> 00:03:20.479
And finally, how modest are you?

00:03:20.479 --> 00:03:23.167
So most of us put ourselves above average

00:03:23.167 --> 00:03:25.196
on most of these abilities.

00:03:25.196 --> 00:03:27.327
Now this is statistically impossible.

00:03:27.327 --> 00:03:30.556
We can't all be better than everyone else.